# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MotoVault — Root Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# This file documents shared env vars used by Turborepo tasks.
# Each app also has its own .env.example:
#   apps/api/.env.example    — NestJS API server
#   apps/web/.env.example    — Next.js web app
#   apps/mobile/.env.example — Expo mobile app
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values for local development.

# ── Supabase (shared across apps) ──
SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-local-anon-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-local-service-role-key

# ── Linear (optional — used by CI/scripts) ──
# LINEAR_API_KEY=

# ── Sentry (optional in dev) ──
# SENTRY_DSN=
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=
# SENTRY_ORG=
# SENTRY_PROJECT=

# ── Mapbox (optional in dev) ──
# MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
